<title>UK: Sole Brent date kept - traders.</title>
<headline>Sole Brent date kept - traders.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The lone Brent date nominated from the paper chains on Wednesday was kept ahead of the five o'clock deadline, traders said.</p>
<p>The cargo, loading Jan 23-25, was kept by Texaco, they said.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 5387</p>
</text>
